WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.265
- If anything besides 
being practical

00:00:02.265 --> 00:00:04.465
and start making money 
instead of losing money

00:00:04.465 --> 00:00:07.146
is what you remember
from this talk this morning,

00:00:07.146 --> 00:00:10.486
please make it that you need
to go to a senior citizen home

00:00:10.486 --> 00:00:12.356
and volunteer for one day.

00:00:12.356 --> 00:00:13.665
Here's what I want you to do.

00:00:13.665 --> 00:00:16.516
Spend one day at a 
senior citizen home

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:18.916
and I promise you you 
will leave with the following.

00:00:18.916 --> 00:00:21.986
You will leave that the 
scariest thing in the world,

00:00:21.986 --> 00:00:26.666
the scariest thing in the world
to human beings is regret.

00:00:27.346 --> 00:00:30.296
What you will see in 
those 80 and 90-year-olds,

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:33.076
some will be happy 
and they'll be content,

00:00:33.076 --> 00:00:36.010
but you will see 
something at scale that scares

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:37.761
the living shit out of me.

00:00:37.761 --> 00:00:39.601
It's called regret.

00:00:39.601 --> 00:00:42.361
The amount of people 
that wish they did things

00:00:42.361 --> 00:00:44.820
is scary and let me 
promise you something.

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:48.336
When you're 93, 
it's hard to pull it off.

00:00:48.336 --> 00:00:51.976
("Unbreakable" by Benjamin Katz)

